{"id":"nave:eleazar-eleazer","source":"nave","name":"Eleazar (Eleazer)","slug":"eleazar-eleazer","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. Son of Aaron Ex 6:23; 28:1","refs":[["Exod",6,23,6,23],["Exod",28,1,28,1]]},{"text":"Married a daughter of Putiel, who bore him Phinehas Ex 6:25","refs":[["Exod",6,25,6,25]]},{"text":"After the death of Nadab and Abihu is made chief of the tribe of Levi Nu 3:32","refs":[["Num",3,32,3,32]]},{"text":"Duties of Nu 4:16","refs":[["Num",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"Succeeds Aaron as high priest Nu 20:26,28; De 10:6","refs":[["Num",20,26,20,26],["Num",20,28,20,28],["Deut",10,6,10,6]]},{"text":"Assists Moses in the census Nu 26:63","refs":[["Num",26,63,26,63]]},{"text":"With Joshua, divides Palestine Nu 34:17","refs":[["Num",34,17,34,17]]},{"text":"Death and burial of Jos 24:33","refs":[["Josh",24,33,24,33]]},{"text":"Descendants of 1Ch 24:1-19","refs":[["1Chr",24,1,24,19]]},{"text":"2. An inhabitant of Kirjath-jearim who tended the ark of the covenant for a while 1Sa 7:1,2","refs":[["1Sam",7,1,7,1],["1Sam",7,2,7,2]]},{"text":"3. A Merarite Levite 1Ch 23:21,22; 24:28","refs":[["1Chr",23,21,23,21],["1Chr",23,22,23,22],["1Chr",24,28,24,28]]},{"text":"4. Son of Dodo, and one of David’s distinguished heroes 2Sa 23:9,10,13; 1Ch 11:12","refs":[["2Sam",23,9,23,9],["2Sam",23,10,23,10],["2Sam",23,13,23,13],["1Chr",11,12,11,12]]},{"text":"5. Son of Phinehas Ezr 8:33; Ne 12:42","refs":[["Ezra",8,33,8,33],["Neh",12,42,12,42]]},{"text":"6. A returned Israelitish exile Ezr 10:25","refs":[["Ezra",10,25,10,25]]}],"refCount":24}
